{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54102","headline":"真人酬寄羡门子 · 曹唐","name":"真人酬寄羡门子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云洞烟深意自迷，忆君肠断武陵溪。\n三山未觉家中远，九府那知路甚低。\n绦阙有时申再会，赤城何日手重携。\n唯愁不得分明语，惆怅长霄月又西。\n（见《四库珍本初集》本《天台前集别编》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}